Each hypothesis is one fact of the given field, written as 'Field: value' in text, with the bare value in value. For a missing or unverifiable target, text names the fact a reader would look for (for example 'Date: dispatch date of the parcel') and value is null.

{
  "documents": [
    {
      "title": "Website build brief",
      "text": "Buyer: Mira\nBusiness: Petal Lantern Studio\nSeller: Arun Sen\nBusiness: Indigo Finch Webworks, India\n\nPlease build a five-page website for our small floral design studio. The pages should cover our home page, services, portfolio, studio story, and contact information. We will supply the photographs and final wording. The contact page should include a working inquiry form, and the site should display properly on phones. Please deliver the finished site files and a short handover guide by 18 September 2026. The agreed fixed project price is USD 850. Any additional pages or ongoing maintenance will need a separate agreement."
    },
    {
      "title": "Buyer-seller chat",
      "text": "Mira, 09:12: I've sent the photographs and copy for all five pages. Please use the newest portfolio selection.\nArun Sen, 09:19: Received. I'll build the inquiry form with the contact details you provided and test the layout on mobile.\nMira, 09:24: Thank you. Please include the handover guide with the site files, as discussed.\nArun Sen, 09:31: Yes. The delivery date remains 18 September 2026, and the fixed price is USD 850.\nMira, 09:35: Confirmed. I don't need hosting or monthly maintenance included in this project.\nArun Sen, 09:40: Understood. I'll let you know when the first draft is ready for review."
    },
    {
      "title": "Website services invoice",
      "text": "Indigo Finch Webworks\nIndia\nPrepared by: Arun Sen\nBill to: Mira, Petal Lantern Studio\nIssue date: 2 September 2026\n\nWebsite design and build, five pages: USD 750\nInquiry form, mobile testing, and handover guide: USD 100\nTotal: USD 850\nPayment method: PayPal\nPayment status: Paid in full\n\nThe project includes the home, services, portfolio, studio story, and contact pages described in the buyer's brief. The buyer will provide the text and images. Finished site files and a short handover guide are due on 18 September 2026. Hosting, additional pages, and ongoing maintenance are not included in this fixed price."
    }
  ],
  "hypotheses": [
    {
      "text": "Amount: USD 850",
      "value": "USD 850"
    },
    {
      "text": "Deliverable: five-page website",
      "value": "five-page website"
    },
    {
      "text": "Date: 18 September 2026",
      "value": "18 September 2026"
    },
    {
      "text": "Party: Mira",
      "value": "Mira"
    },
    {
      "text": "Party: Arun Sen",
      "value": "Arun Sen"
    }
  ]
}
